# bash-09-grade-report

Bash-09-grade-report built to help rebase instructor to calculate average and rank student

## Problem_Statement​

At the end of every month, Rebase instructors receive a spreadsheet of scores and spend an evening calculating averages and rankings by hand. Build grades.sh so it takes two seconds.

## 📌 Project Goals

Automated Ingestion & Validation

Real-World Data Sanitization

Dynamic Analytics & Ranking

Executive Presentation

## Tech stack

- Bash
- ShellCheck
- Git & Github

